    "text": "By Erin Slaughter ,\n21 hours ago AUSTIN, Texas — No. 1 Texas played its first road and SEC game of the season Saturday at Tennessee’s Neyland Stadium. The Longhorns led 10-3 at halftime before Tennessee tied the game in the third quarter. Texas entered the matchup 3-0 after a 30-6 win over UTSA last... Read full article",
